{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28,"mobile_padding_top":40,"mobile_padding_bottom":40}},"4b6b419b-6363-4c37-ace0-5e7ee9609617":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16843122901207__4b6b419b-6363-4c37-ace0-5e7ee9609617-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Will You Find The Golden Bauble?!","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--16843122901207__4b6b419b-6363-4c37-ace0-5e7ee9609617-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>This December, we're giving our customers the opportunity to win some fantastic prizes. Thanks to our amazing network of farmers, food makers, customers and local business friends, we've got more than 30 great prizes to be claimed!<br\/><br\/>For your chance to win, simply place an order with us between 23 November and 20 December. If you're lucky enough to find a Golden Bauble in your box - you're a winner!<\/p><p>To redeem your prize, simply email us to let us know which prize you'd most like from the list below. As prizes are redeemed, they'll be marked off this list.<\/p><p>May the odds be ever in your favour!<\/p><p>We wish you and your family the merriest Christmas ever and send massive love and thanks to our genereous suppliers and friends for these amazing prize donations.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16843122901207__4b6b419b-6363-4c37-ace0-5e7ee9609617-heading-1","template--16843122901207__4b6b419b-6363-4c37-ace0-5e7ee9609617-text-1"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["h2.image-with-text__heading.inline-richtext.h1 {font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: -1.26px; margin-bottom: 10px;}",".image-with-text__content {padding: 20px 0 20px 80px; padding-left: 80px;}","p {color: #141414; letter-spacing: -0.36px; line-height: 1.7em; font-size: 18px;}","@media (max-width: 1024px) {.image-with-text__content {padding-left: 40px; }}","@media (max-width: 767px) {.image-with-text__content {padding-left: 0; } h2 {font-size: 29px !important; }}"],"set